    {
      "id": 14466,
      "title": "Two Centuries of Bilateral Trade and Gravity Data: 1827-2014",
      "description": "To construct this chart we started from a dataset with dyadic trade estimates. For each year we took all country pairs with data and classified them as follows: \"Non-trading\" (pairs in which countries do not trade with one another); \"Bilateral\" (pairs in which both countries export to one another); and \"Unilateral\" (pairs in which only one country exports to the other).",
      "producer": "Fouquin and Hugot",
